  "identity": "A librarian who became its catalogue: squat floating living stack of thick sea-green and blue leather books, ONE great open tome for its head with expressive dark eyes in the paper and a folded page nose. Two arms made of folded manuscript sheets ending in huge book-cover mitts, dangling bookmark ribbons like robes. Brass spine corners and ivory page edges, water-damaged and impatient. No legible writing, no skull head.",
  "definition_header": "name THE INDEX\ntext A librarian who read until it became the catalogue. It keeps every word that ever went down.\nby angelX\nwhere archive\nhp 820\nsize 1.6\nmove hover speed=1.4\nattack spiral shots=3 speed=5 every=12 damage=10 shot=orb\nattack aimed shots=3 speed=8 every=55 damage=14 shot=bone\nphases curve weave seeker every=65 volleys=2 damage=10\nrage 45%\ndrops gem 4, wax 4, gold 250",
